WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:01.993 --> 00:00:05.176 position:63%
The mating period is an
extremely grueling time

00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.818 position:63%
for the little ones left
to fend for themselves.

00:00:08.922 --> 00:00:11.484 position:63%
They are easy prey and
the predators know it.

00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:20.421 position:63%
The hyenas that live on these
coasts have faced many ordeals.

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:24.423 position:63%
They often bear the scars.

00:00:31.089 --> 00:00:33.131 position:63%
In order to survive this inhospitable

00:00:33.171 --> 00:00:35.753 position:63%
environment, they had
to change their habits.

00:00:37.055 --> 00:00:40.838 position:63%
Mainly nocturnal and scavengers,
they now forage during

00:00:40.858 --> 00:00:44.282 position:63%
the day as well and have
become fearful predators.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.341 position:63%
Their hunting technique is efficient.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.543 position:63%
Just spot the right target and make
sure its mother is not around.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.062 position:63%
This skilled hunter takes
the correct attitude.

00:01:30.761 --> 00:01:33.402 position:63%
It has set its sights on a
little one sated with milk.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.078 position:63%
And the risk is worth the reward.

00:01:42.588 --> 00:01:45.750 position:63%
The nutritional value of the
milk and the brains of recently

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:48.573 position:63%
killed pups is much greater
than that of a dead one.

00:01:54.387 --> 00:01:58.370 position:63%
Black-backed jackals have also adapted
remarkably to this environment.

00:02:00.099 --> 00:02:04.363 position:63%
Organized gangs or tandems are increasing
the number of raids on the beach.

00:02:14.481 --> 00:02:16.802 position:63%
The couples have developed
a well-honed strategy.

00:02:17.843 --> 00:02:19.163 position:63%
While one chooses a victim,

00:02:23.506 --> 00:02:24.806 position:63%
the other watches its back.

00:02:38.146 --> 00:02:40.730 position:63%
This young couple hasn't
yet mastered the technique.

00:02:41.988 --> 00:02:46.176 position:63%
By consuming this meal on sight, they
are spared the chore of transporting it.

